  "notes": [
    "Regular -ER verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Often used with \"a\": *ceder a algo* (\"to give in to something\").",
    "*Los personajes ceden al innegable placer de perder el control.* (\"The characters give in to the undeniable pleasure of losing control.\")",
    "*No debes ceder ante la presión.* (\"You shouldn't give in to the pressure.\")",
    "Related: *la cesión* (transfer/yielding, noun), *rendirse* (near-synonym, \"to surrender\"), *resistir* (antonym, \"to resist\")."
